  "body": "## Release Notes\n\n- README: badges, cited research behind each rule, Folvix link; issue and PR templates.\n- Codex-native marketplace file (.agents/plugins/marketplace.json); install table covers Cursor and OpenCode.\n- docs/quickstart.md, verified by scripts/check_docs.py in CI; examples/quickstart-run with the real run state.\n- docs/troubleshooting.md and docs/windows.md.\n- Demo GIF in README; `pip install stillwright` packaging (maturin) with a PyPI Trusted Publishing workflow.\n\n## Install stillwright 0.1.1\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/HamzaIlyas/stillwright/releases/download/v0.1.1/stillwright-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script\n\n```sh\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c \"irm https://github.com/HamzaIlyas/stillwright/releases/download/v0.1.1/stillwright-installer.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n## Download stillwright 0.1.1\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [stillwright-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/HamzaIlyas/stillwright/releases/download/v0.1.1/stillwright-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/HamzaIlyas/stillwright/releases/download/v0.1.1/stillwright-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [stillwright-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/HamzaIlyas/stillwright/releases/download/v0.1.1/stillwright-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/HamzaIlyas/stillwright/releases/download/v0.1.1/stillwright-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [stillwright-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/HamzaIlyas/stillwright/releases/download/v0.1.1/stillwright-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/HamzaIlyas/stillwright/releases/download/v0.1.1/stillwright-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [stillwright-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/HamzaIlyas/stillwright/releases/download/v0.1.1/stillwright-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/HamzaIlyas/stillwright/releases/download/v0.1.1/stillwright-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [stillwright-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/HamzaIlyas/stillwright/releases/download/v0.1.1/stillwright-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/HamzaIlyas/stillwright/releases/download/v0.1.1/stillwright-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n\n"
